# loom's files that stay on this machine: what it rebuilds, its caches and runtime state, and its copies of other people's documents. Everything else here is committed: the history, the acceptance ledger, annotations, sessions, digests, and a stored document's page text, which lets a coauthor who holds no PDF re-check a transcription. `loom upgrade` rewrites the lines above the last.
build/
serve.json
since/
last-seen.json
sessions/*/attached.json
sessions/*/cursors/
digests/storage/**/paper.pdf
digests/storage/**/src/
digests/storage/cache/
# your own lines go below this one; loom upgrade keeps them
